{% case_body "Design it.<br>Build it.<br>Train with it." %}
  <p>No brief. No client. Just the app I always wished existed, built around how I actually train. A web app that lives on my phone like a native one: upload the coach's <strong>PDF or CSV</strong>, it splits the weeks into days, then it gets out of the way.</p>
  <p>Most gym apps feel like they were built by someone who's <em>never used one</em>. Too rigid. Supersets buried. So I built every flexibility I've ever missed, and nothing I haven't.</p>
  {% ruled %}
    {% ruled_row "PDF → app", "Upload a coach's plan, train off it the same day" %}
    {% ruled_row "Daily use", "Replaced the Google Doc on day one" %}
    {% ruled_row "Built with AI", "Voice note → Claude → ship. Repeat." %}
  {% endruled %}
{% endcase_body %}

