{% case_body "Where it's going." %}
  <p>Right now I'm building a <strong>coach login</strong>. A PT sees all their clients in one place and amends plans directly, which cuts out the back and forth across Google Docs, Excel and PDFs. Then <strong>open it up</strong>: a free tier for the basics, a paid one for PDF import, custom set structures and long-term progress. No timeline. It earns its keep every time I open it.</p>
{% endcase_body %}

